{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/8c6334914fdfb4bd9c493ffbde355718.avif?t=1765248161\" width=320 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Jeremy the Rooster, you are the last line of defense between your precious flock and the endless hordes of hungry predators. Also, you have a shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chick Game</i> is a <strong>boomer shooter survival mashup</strong> where mornings are for tending the flock, building defenses, and gathering upgrades \u2014 and nights are for turning the countryside into a feather-filled warzone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive? Or will your coop become an all-you-can-eat buffet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shotgun-Wielding Rooster Mayhem</strong><br>You\u2019re a rooster with a gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/7047b50d3509dea2fd6384ee5f8f8e23.avif?t=1765248161\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras_big/7047b50d3509dea2fd6384ee5f8f8e23.avif?t=1765248161 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime: Upgrade and Prepare</strong><br>Get stronger, faster, and hit harder by caring for the flock during the day. Reinforce the coop, build junk piles to slow incoming predators, or taunt them with scarecrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/b8bf8ad9a83a476bef358a50fda9e59a.poster.avif?t=1765248161\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/b8bf8ad9a83a476bef358a50fda9e59a.webm?t=1765248161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/b8bf8ad9a83a476bef358a50fda9e59a.mp4?t=1765248161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nighttime: Make your Stand</strong><br>Waves of predators swarm the coop. Raccoons, foxes, bears, and whatever else thinks chicken nuggets are on the menu.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/afda3b2b7600a2bb17ce05c59029dff2.poster.avif?t=1765248161\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/afda3b2b7600a2bb17ce05c59029dff2.webm?t=1765248161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800580/extras/afda3b2b7600a2bb17ce05c59029dff2.mp4?t=1765248161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Ways to Play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong>: Survive 7 nights with unique predators each night. Simple. Not easy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Mode</strong>: Each night gets harder as you face a growing force of random enemies. How long will you survive?</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Classic Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3800580/bc0ff0aabf20531f092af25fc38ec9db4b751276.jpg"},{"name":"Chaos Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3800580/bc0ff0aabf20531f092af25fc38ec9db4b751276.jpg"},{"name":"Reach New Heights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco